A/THR indications are no more displayed on the <abb>PFD</abb>.</para></command></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00008905.0002001.032" memory="false"><cr-action code="00008905.0002001.018"><challenge>A/THR</challenge><response>On</response></cr-action></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00008905.0002001.033" memory="false"><command code="00008905.0002001.019"><para layer="1" lid="N.00008905.0002001.034">Check that the <tech-label type="pb">A/THR</tech-label> light bars are ON.</para></command></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00008905.0002001.035" memory="false"><command code="00008905.0002001.020"><para layer="1" lid="N.00008905.0002001.036">Check that green SPEED and white
